[1m[38;5;231mHow should the event-type filter work?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mCheckboxes + shortcuts (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mNine type checkboxes, plus 'Failed sign-ins' and 'Security changes' buttons that tick preset sets[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Checkboxes only
     [38;5;246mNine type checkboxes; no page-defined groups[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Grouped Select
     [38;5;246mOne Select with groups and types; single choice at a time[39m
